# Instagram OAuth ("Business Login for Instagram") credentials — server
# side only, never exposed to the client. Required for the app to work at
# all: without these, "Увійти через Instagram" fails with a clear error.
#
# 1. Create an app at https://developers.facebook.com/apps (or the
#    Instagram Platform app type at developers.facebook.com).
# 2. Add the "Instagram" product, use case "Business Login for Instagram".
# 3. Register a Valid OAuth Redirect URI for every environment you run,
#    exactly: <your-app-origin>/api/auth/instagram/callback
#    e.g. http://localhost:3000/api/auth/instagram/callback for local dev.
# 4. Copy the app's Instagram App ID / App Secret below.
# 5. While the app is in Development mode (default), only Instagram
#    accounts added as "Instagram testers" under App Roles can log in —
#    perfect for personal use, no App Review needed.
INSTAGRAM_APP_ID=
INSTAGRAM_APP_SECRET=
